0-0100 | M (555) 010-0101</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">100 Main Street, Anytown, ST 00000</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><a href=\"mailto:pat@yourcompany.com\">pat@yourcompany.com</a> | <a href=\"https://www.yourcompany.com/\">www.yourcompany.com</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>From:</b> Kordahl Advisory &lt;info@kordahladvisory.example&gt; <br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 6, 2026 1:58 PM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Pat Staffer &lt;pat@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Your enquiry - portfolio review<o:p></o:p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear Pat,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you for your enquiry about our portfolio review service. I have attached our engagement overview and fee schedule. I would be glad to set up a call with you and your client next week.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Kind regards,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><a href=\"mailto:lena.fischer@kordahladvisory.example?subject=Your%20enquiry%20-%20portfolio%20review\"><span style=\"color:#1F3864;text-decoration:none\">Lena Fischer</span></a></b><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Senior Associate<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Kordahl Advisory<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">200 W Madison Street, Suite 1200 | Chicago, IL 60606<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Tel +1 (555) 010-0134<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://www.kordahladvisory.example/\">www.kordahladvisory.example</a><o:p></o:p></p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
